{"id": "34610", "title": "还珠格格续集", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 64, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34610/34610s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34610.htm", "intro": "乾隆二十五年，新疆王将掌上明珠含香献给乾隆皇帝！因为她的来临，开启故事的另一高潮！小燕子、紫薇、永琪、尔康得知含香和心上人蒙丹的相恋故事，竟‘路见不平’，决定要助有情人终成眷属！也因此埋下两位格格被斩首的种子。皇太后此时回京，对两位‘民间格格’大为不满，狠辣的皇后也想除掉两个‘民间格格’，而在旁伺机而动。阻力重重、危机四伏，小燕子偏偏又状况百出，这次他们能再次安然度过吗？……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34610", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部  风云再起", "volume": true}, {"title": "序  篇", "file": "2199329.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "2199330.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2199331.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2199332.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2199333.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2199334.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2199335.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2199336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "2199337.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "2199338.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "2199339.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "2199340.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "2199341.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "2199342.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "2199343.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部  生死相许", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "2199345.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "2199346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "2199347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "2199348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "2199349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "2199350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "2199351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "2199352.html", "available": false}, {"title": 